          "old_code": "AT-515 to AT-520 fail on 0e75e35 (writers commit while Apply is past its recheck; an in-flight reservation is applied stale)."
        },
        {
          "id": "R2",
          "title": "Bounded transcription responses and honest completeness",
          "note": "The transport reads under a strict byte budget with early cancellation, strict UTF-8, and safe-integer validation; an over-long transcript is refused with its measured liability settled; oversized or malformed answers keep the charge unknown; nothing incomplete is stored, shown, saved, or interpreted.",
